  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tagari-Dogon Cereal Capacity Building Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to provide a variety of trainings and capacity building support; to purchase and market cereals and build a warehouse that will allow the Union to strengthen its presence in the market as well as improve on the timeliness and quality of services it provides to it members.</narrative>
  </description>
